   "text": "Tijuana, Baja California: Mexico's busiest border city, across the line from San Diego. Together they form one metropolitan region split by a wall. The city spreads east and south from the ocean at **Playas de Tijuana** across mesas, and up steep canyons and arroyos. Much of the newer housing sits on those slopes (Barrier 5).",
